thod": 1, "simExamScore": 2, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "正确的态度能够促使个体实现预定目标，获得奖励或避免惩罚。这表明态度具", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 298975, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "正确", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "正确。\n观察是有目的、有计划的知觉。同时，在观察过程中，自始至终有思维的参与。而一般知觉不一定有目 的、有计划，也不一定有思维的参与。目的性、计划性、思维的概括性是高级心理活动的特点。因此说 观察是知觉的高级形式。\n", "b": "错误", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 216, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298976, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 2, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 422, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "A", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "观察是知觉的高级形式。", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 298976, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "正确", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "错误。\n人格是一个人区别于他人的稳定而统一的心理品质，因此人格具有稳定性。那些偶尔表现出来的特征 不能称之为人格。\n", "b": "错误", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 298, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298977, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "单选", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 1, "optNum": 2, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 422, "questionType": 1, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "B", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "人格不具有稳定性。", "topicType": "单选题", "ueId": 298977, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "（1）德育过程是对学生知、情、意、行的培养提高过程；\n（2）德育过程是促使学生思想内部矛盾斗争的发展过程；\n（3）德育过程是组织学生的活动和交往，统一多方面教育影响的过程；\n（4）德育过程是一个长期的、反复的、逐步提高的过程。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 16, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298960, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 423, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "德育过程有哪些基本规律?", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 298960, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "1）传递保存文化；\n（2）交流融合文化；\n（3）选择文化；\n（4）更新创造文化。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 19, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298961, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 423, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "简述教育的文化功能。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 298961, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 30}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "（1）遵守法律、法规；\n（2）遵守学生行为规范，尊敬师长，养成良好的思想品德和行为习惯；\n（3）努力学习，完成规定的学习任务；\n（4）遵守其所在学校或者其他教育机构的管理制度和规定。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 15, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298962, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 424, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 8, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 8, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "我国《教育法》中对学生的义务作了哪些规定?", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 298962, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 31}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "王老师贯彻的主要教学原则有：\r\n（1）直观性原则。王老师通过对具体事物的测量让学生掌握物体长度的概念，生动直观，形象具体；\r\n（2）理论联系实际原则。王老师没有单纯地讲授物体长度的理论，而是联系生活实际，将直接经验和间 接经验较好地结合起来；\r\n(3)巩固性原则。王老师在结课前又对学到的长度概念进行概括总结并要求学生课外练习，以巩固所学知识。\r\n心理学部分\r\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 14, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">阅读下列案例，并回答问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">[案例]</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">王老师是一位胖胖的数学老师。有一次在讲完厘米、分米和米的概念后，马上让学生们测量桌子、铅笔、书本和手臂的长度。班上顿时炸开了锅，一只只胳膊高举着要求测 量。被点名的同学经过测量报出答案后，都得到了表扬，嘴巴笑成了一朵朵花。那些没 被点到名字的学生着急了，高举着手喊:“老师，快叫我！快叫我！”</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">“桌子、铅笔、书本和手臂的长度都量过了，我们还想测量什么呢？”老师的话音刚落，一个男孩噌地站起来：“老师，我想测测你的腰围。”班上一下静了，同学们都转过头 看着这个男孩不知所措，老师低头看了一下自己的腰，边笑边朝那个男孩说着：“好啊， 你来量吧。”</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">小男孩拿着尺子，用手按住尺子的一端，让尺子在老师的肚皮上翻着跟头，跟头翻了 好几个，他最后报出测量的结果是87厘米。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">“不错，他量得很认真，答案也比较接近。”老师不失时机地问了一句：“其他同学有 没有更好的办法测得更准确一些？ ”她的话音刚落，一个胖乎乎的女孩站起来说：“老师，我有，我用手。”</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">老师问：“你用手怎么量呢？”小女孩说：“我的手掌是11厘米，我看腰有几掌就知 道了。”</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">老师笑着点点头，说：“可以。”小女孩的手在老师的腰上爬，刚爬了一圈之后，她就 报出了答案“89厘米。”</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">笑容在老师和同学的脸上绽放，班级的气氛更活跃了……</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:27px\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">下课前，王老师对物体长度的概念做了总结，并要求学生课后结合生活中的事物做</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">长度的测量练习。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14px;\">[问题]王老师在教学过程中主要贯彻了哪些教学原则？试结合案例加以分析。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>", "exerId": 298963, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "论述题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本教育理论真题", "pracTimesAmount": 424, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 15, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 15, "source": "2017年", "starCount": 0, "title": "王老师在教学过程中主要贯彻了哪些教学原则？试结合案例加以分析。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 298963, "umcId": 13746071, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 32}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "1）人的知觉特点。\n（2）定势与功能固着。\n（3）已有知识经验。\n（4）情绪与动机。\n（5）个性差异。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 20, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 298978, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "简答题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2017年成考专升本